OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and mostly cloudy in the
OL,6,Fmorning and afternoon with some bright
OL,7,Fintervals. Rain and hill snow, heavy
OL,8,Fat times, spreading east in the
OL,9,Fevening. Winds strengthening with
OL,10,Fcoastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStrong
OL,13,Fwinds, rain and hills snow early
OL,14,FFriday clearing to bright spells and
OL,15,Fshowers. Mostly dry and cloudy on
OL,16,FSaturday, then rain overnight. Heavy
OL,17,Fshowers spreading east Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
